	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following text is about the account payable process. It begins when you send to the senior accountant in your department. 
Once sending to the senior accountant in your department occurs, creating a receiving report should be done. 
After creating a receiving report, gathering the receiving report needs to be done. 
After gathering the receiving report, the next tasks should be checking dates to avoid penalty charges and scheduling the payment, they should be done in parallel. 
